@startuml LogiShop_Monolith_Architecture
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #333333
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333

title Figure 3.3. Simple illustration of Monolith Architecture — LogiShop

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<presentation>> #C8E6C9
  BorderColor #2E7D32
}
skinparam rectangle<<controller>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
  BorderColor #F9A825
}
skinparam rectangle<<model>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFECB3
  BorderColor #FF8F00
}

' Outer monolith boundary
rectangle "Monolith\n**(single Next.js application — one deployable unit)**" as MON #F5F5F5 {

  ' Inner dashed "same codebase" (Frame = dashed border in PlantUML)
  package "Same codebase" <<Frame>> #FFFFFF {
    together {
      rectangle "**Presentation (View — Frontend)**\n• `app/**` pages (App Router)\n• `components/**` UI, maps, forms\n• Client auth state (e.g. React context)" <<presentation>> as L1

      rectangle "**Controller / application logic**\n• `app/api/**` route handlers\n• Input validation (Zod), JWT auth, roles\n• Order workflow, UPS integration orchestration" <<controller>> as L2

      rectangle "**Model & data access**\n• Types / serializers (`lib/`)\n• Supabase client, queries & writes\n• Aligns with DB tables (`order_ups`, …)" <<model>> as L3
    }
    L1 -[hidden]down- L2
    L2 -[hidden]down- L3
  }
}

together {
  database "**Centralized database**\n**Supabase (PostgreSQL)**\n• `order_ups`, `users`, `tracking_history`,\n  `exchange_rates`, locations, …" as DB #E1BEE7
}

L3 -down-> DB : Persistent storage\n(SQL / Supabase API)

note bottom of MON
  **External dependencies** (not separate deployable services): UPS Tracking / Rating APIs,\n  map tile / geocoding providers as configured — invoked from **Controller** layer inside the monolith.
end note

@enduml
